  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="2545eea6-77b3-5d5a-a121-4fe1d9b0e6de" activityNameId="e3b9cd5c-01b4-5ed1-8c7a-df277dde61ef" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, sewer system, polymer concrete pipe, DN 600, profile 2A</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, sewer system, polymer concrete pipe, DN 600, profile 2A
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 03375fe8-aae8-4b0e-859f-0fdf593a11f8
This process models deconstruction and end-of-life treatment for 1 meter of installed sewer infrastructure with polymer concrete pipe. DN 600, profile 2A according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for 1 meter of sewer system with poylmer concrete iron pipe, DN 600, profile 2A. The operation of similar types of building machines across different processes is aggregated to one process.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: DN 600, profile 2A according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. Polymer concrete pipe, ID 600 mm, outer diameter 710 mm, wall thickness 55 mm, 260 kg/m, 2300 kg/m³. 
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_03375fe8-aae8-4b0e-859f-0fdf593a11f8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
